    85→    <p class="artist-card__bio">From 24 August to 13 September 2026, Konishi will be at ICST for her Studio Residency. She will create a new work for presentation at the <strong>Sonic Matter Festival 2027</strong>, deepening the integration of narrative structures and sensory immersion in spatial composition.</p>
